{"id":"actuacio_n","lemma":"actuación","pos":"noun","rank":1886,"glosses":["performance (a live show or concert)","acting (the occupation of an actor)","action (something done to accomplish a purpose)"],"ipa":"/aɡtwaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"actuaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-actuaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La actuación grácil del bailarín hechizó a la audiencia.","en":"The dancer's graceful action charmed the audience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692759"},{"text":"Su actuación fue asombrosa.","en":"His performance was amazing."},{"text":"Fue una actuación terrible.","en":"It was an awful performance."},{"text":"¡Que actuación tan extraordinaria!","en":"What a remarkable performance!"},{"text":"¿Cuándo acaba la actuación?","en":"When does the performance end?"}]}